		(property "Description" "TVS diode, unidirectional, 36 V stand-off, 40 to 44.2 V breakdown, 58.1 V clamp at 51.6 A, 3 kW (10/1000 us), DO-214AB (SMC), Littelfuse SMDJ36A. Coil X- output clamp to GND. Optional, not fitted by default: the DRV8873 body diodes and the supply TVS D1201 already clamp the outputs; fit only if surges or ESD on the coil leads are a problem, because it adds capacitance on a switching output"
